{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["审判邻国"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和华的启示：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人与以色列各支派的眼目都仰望耶和华。","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的惩罚必临到哈得拉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"临到大马士革，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及与大马士革比邻的哈马。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"极其聪明的泰尔和西顿也无法逃脱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰尔为自己建造堡垒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堆积的银子多如尘土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金子多如街上的泥土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，看啊，主必夺去她的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁她海上的权势，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必被火吞噬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"亚实基伦见状必陷入恐惧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦萨见状必充满痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革伦也一样，因为她希望破灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦萨必失去君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚实基伦必荒无人烟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"混杂的种族必占领亚实突，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"必铲除非利士人的骄傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除去他们口中带血的肉和齿间的可憎之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"余下的人必归属我","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为犹大的一族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革伦人必像耶布斯人一样归属我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我家四周安营，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不容敌人入侵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不容外人来欺压我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为现在我亲自看顾他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["要来的君王"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"少女锡安啊，要充满喜乐！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女耶路撒冷啊，要欢呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你的王到你这里来了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是公义、得胜的王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谦卑地骑着驴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骑着一头驴驹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必铲除以法莲的战车，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除耶路撒冷的战马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战弓必被折断。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必向列国宣告和平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必统治四海之疆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从幼发拉底河直到地极。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安啊，因为我用血跟你立了约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将你中间被掳的人从无水之坑释放出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有盼望的被掳者啊，回到你们的堡垒吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"今日我宣布，我必加倍地补偿你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把犹大当弓拉开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把以法莲当箭搭上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使锡安的众子如勇士之剑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去攻打希腊的众子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华必在他们上面显现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的箭如闪电射出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华必吹响号角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乘南方的暴风而来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华必保护他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必用弹石消灭、征服敌人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"饮血呐喊，犹如醉酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像献祭用的碗盛满了血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像祭坛的四角淌满了血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，他们的上帝耶和华必拯救他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"视他们为一群祂的子民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必如王冠上的宝石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"闪耀在祂的土地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那将是何等的奇妙，何等的美好！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五谷必滋养少男，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒必滋养少女。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"“世人与以色列各支派的眼目都仰望耶和华”或译“耶和华鉴察以色列各支派，也鉴察所有的世人”。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":1}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“我”指耶和华，下同。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":6}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"“我”希伯来文作“我们的上帝”。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}